Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.59,0:01:32.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnYusei Magic}ｺﾞｯﾄﾞ･ﾚｲｼﾞ！\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}神之愤怒！
