Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.46,0:20:56.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnYusei Magic}(Ⅳ)俺たちは…｡\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}({\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅳ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe})我们…。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.45,0:20:58.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnYusei Magic}(Ⅲ)兄様！\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}({\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅲ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe})哥哥大人！
